    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d412">

                <pb facs="1555" n="1531" sameAs="frus:frus1946v02/pg1531"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.F.M. Files: Lot
                    M–88: Box 2079: CFM Documents</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decision of the Council of Foreign
                        Ministers</hi><anchor n="40" xml:id="d412-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        CFM(46) (NY)73</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New
                                York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1946-12-11"
                            >December 11, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Questions Relating to Germany and
                        Austria</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">agenda for the council of foreign
                        ministers in moscow on march 10, 1947</hi></p>
                <p>The next meeting of the Council of Foreign Ministers will be held at held at
                    Moscow on March 10, 1947. The agenda for the session will include the following: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Consideration of a Report to be supplied by the Allied Control
                            Authority, which should deal with the following subjects: <list>
                                <label><hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>.</label>
                                <item>Work of the Control Council since its creation on the
                                    following points: demilitarization, denazification,
                                    democratization, economic principles, reparations;</item>
                                <label><hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>.</label>
                                <item>The establishment of central administrations and other
                                    problems connected with the economic, financial and political
                                    situation of Germany under quadripartite government;</item>
                                <label><hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</label>
                                <item>Liquidation of Prussia.</item>
                            </list></item>
                        <pb facs="1556" n="1532" xml:id="pg1532"/>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Consideration of the form and scope of the provisional political
                            organization of Germany</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>Preparation of a Peace Treaty with Germany: <list>
                                <label><hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>.</label>
                                <item>Report of the Deputies for Germany: <list>
                                        <label>i)</label>
                                        <item>Procedure;</item>
                                        <label>ii)</label>
                                        <item>Hearings of other Governments;</item>
                                    </list></item>
                                <label><hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>.</label>
                                <item>Basic directives: <list>
                                        <label>i)</label>
                                        <item>Future boundaries of Germany;</item>
                                        <label>ii)</label>
                                        <item>Proposals for the Ruhr and Rhineland;</item>
                                        <label>iii)</label>
                                        <item>Other questions.</item>
                                    </list></item>
                            </list></item>
                        <label>4.</label>
                        <item>U.S. draft disarmament and demilitarization treaty and other measures
                            for political, economic and military control of Germany.</item>
                        <label>5.</label>
                        <item>Consideration of the report already submitted by the Committee of Coal
                            Experts.</item>
                        <label>6.</label>
                        <item>Austrian Treaty and related matters.</item>
                    </list></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d412-f1" n="40" type="source" xml:id="d412-f1-content">
                <p>This agenda was approved by the Council of Foreign Ministers at its 22nd Meeting,
                    December 11, 1946; see the United States Delegation Minutes and the Record of
                    Decisions of that meeting, <ref target="#pg1521">pp. 1521</ref> and <ref
                        target="#pg1530">1530</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
